# Local development only. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) before `wrangler dev`.
# MESSAGES_ENC_KEY encrypts the one-time code the fallback chain stores; a catalogue with an otp
# template will not start without it. In a deployed Worker set your own instead:
#   openssl rand -base64 32 | wrangler secret put MESSAGES_ENC_KEY
MESSAGES_ENC_KEY=AAECAwQFBgcICQoLDA0ODxAREhMUFRYXGBkaGxwdHh8=
